{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is dark. you are robot in an ai training programm with a low battery level \u2013 seeking for a charging station that can be usually found at the next exit elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only help you have is a kind of funny gun that shoots bouncing balls, whose trajectories manifest in glowing stripes and make the environment architecture visible. Shoot to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You draw lines in the vicinity between environmental objects, creating a unique construction of lines that let you see the pathways you can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try fail repeat each level until you pass, that unlocks the next one. Be challenged by a world wide leadership board and open Schr\u00f6dinger boxes to get cat (dead or alive) companions, that might be</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >helpful. Feed cats and keep an eye not lose until you end up with a lot of cats. Experience other quantum mechanical phenomena in the game mechanics, like wave partical portal mechanics or graffities that</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >want to teach you essential quantum mechanical equations. Does it make sense? well...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axiomatik uses elements of Arcade games and transfers them into VR: neon like looks, abstract geometrical structures, sound in 8-bit synth aesthetic and in the game play by using game mechanics of platformers adapted for VR.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969490?t=1759238782","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/b64828616fdb214df809ba55e9d74bf94e49f2ce/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759238782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/5784ebe36df776509a063ca4adae7297188e3363/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759238782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/5784ebe36df776509a063ca4adae7297188e3363/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759238782","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is dark. you are robot in an ai training programm with a low battery level \u2013 seeking for a charging station that can be usually found at the next exit elevator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only help you have is a kind of funny gun that shoots bouncing balls, whose trajectories manifest in glowing stripes and make the environment architecture visible. Shoot to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You draw lines in the vicinity between environmental objects, creating a unique construction of lines that let you see the pathways you can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try fail repeat each level until you pass, that unlocks the next one. Be challenged by a world wide leadership board and open Schr\u00f6dinger boxes to get cat (dead or alive) companions, that might be</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >helpful. Feed cats and keep an eye not lose until you end up with a lot of cats. Experience other quantum mechanical phenomena in the game mechanics, like wave partical portal mechanics or graffities that</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >want to teach you essential quantum mechanical equations. Does it make sense? well...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axiomatik uses elements of Arcade games and transfers them into VR: neon like looks, abstract geometrical structures, sound in 8-bit synth aesthetic and in the game play by using game mechanics of platformers adapted for VR.</p>","developers":["J&J"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969490/354b1c5ac9b139bd2b54f1eb2f4a07859570d035/header.j